    {href: "/camera-sensor-cleaning-maintenance-guide", title: "Camera Sensor Cleaning and Maintenance Guide"},
    {href: "/dslr-vs-mirrorless-vs-cinema-camera-2026", title: "DSLR vs Mirrorless vs Cinema Camera — Which to Buy"}
  ]} />

  <CourseCTA text="Budget camera mile ya naya, footage ko elevate karne ka asli tool DaVinci Resolve hai." />

</article>

</Layout>
